  <name>MarkCaptain</name>
  <summary>Local-first Markdown editor with a writing Agent</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      MarkCaptain is a local-first Markdown editor with real-time WYSIWYG editing and an integrated writing Agent. The Agent can read explicitly attached context and propose reviewed changes without taking control of your documents.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Real-time WYSIWYG editing with source, typewriter, and focus modes</li>
      <li>Review-first Agent suggestions with explicit document access</li>
      <li>CommonMark and GitHub Flavored Markdown, tables, tasks, math, and diagrams</li>
      <li>Local-first files with optional project storage and sync providers</li>
      <li>Cross-platform desktop integration, themes, tabs, search, and export</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
